nodes.statement:
If all of the following hold:
  (a) both "unit2" is bagged and "unit2" is logged;
  (b) "unit2" is listed, then "unit7" is classified as "ready_packing_completed".

If all of the following hold:
  (a) both "unit2" is stored and "unit2" is routed;
  (b) "unit2" is shipped, then "unit7" is classified as "ready_staffing_arranged".

All of the following hold:
  (a) all of the following hold:
    (i) if "unit2" is documented, then "unit3" is classified as "clear_contamination_absent";
    (ii) if "unit2" is boxed, then "unit2" is classified as "clear_contamination_absent";
  (b) if "unit2" is retained, then "unit2" is classified as "clear_optically_transparent".

